name: F1 (control_keys.ini [Help]) opens the Online Manual in the pop-up browser (UIPopupBrowserClass 6 'HELP': http://gf1.enb-emulator.com/, a string in client.exe) and its close box closes it
# Unknown_7CB240 is the settings store's real Unknown_7CA2D0Class::Unknown_7CB240 (0x7CB240, DestroyBrowser):
# until then each XFAIL leaves the page drawn and would cost the default run a client start.
# ui_chat_panel.cpp's key 16 makes UIPopupBrowserClass(6, "Online Manual"); the URL from the settings store's table
# (settings_store.cpp 0x7C97B0, client.exe's string at 0x79FE54). See browser_credits for the stand-in.
timeout: 400
include _login
key 0x70
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 30
alive 3
shot browser_manual
click gadget browser.close
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot browser_manual_closed
key 0xC0
expect-event antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET 0x0017, 8 bytes' within 10
